      ],
      "orig": "Table 6.1: Four fish species on IUCN Red List \"Extinct in the Wild\" held in public aquariums.",
      "text": "Table 6.1: Four fish species on IUCN Red List \"Extinct in the Wild\" held in public aquariums."
    },
    {
      "self_ref": "#/texts/1",
      "parent": {
        "$ref": "#/body"
      },
      "children": [],
      "content_layer": "body",
      "label": "text",
      "prov": [
        {
          "page_no": 1,
          "bbox": {
            "l": 56.6929,
            "t": 517.7778999999999,
            "r": 232.8072,
            "b": 341.76199542743535,
            "coord_origin": "BOTTOMLEFT"
          },
          "charspan": [
            0,
            473
          ]
        }
      ],
      "orig": "Public aquariums, because of their inhouse expertise, can act quickly to collect and breed rare fish. Actions to prevent the extinction of the Barrens Topminnow include monitoring populations and propagating and stocking juveniles into existing or newly created spring habitats. The Tennessee Aquarium assisted with propagations and developed a program called \"Keeper Kids,\" where students on spring break help feed the Barrens Topminnows in a behind-the-scenes experience.",
      "text": "Public aquariums, because of their inhouse expertise, can act quickly to collect and breed rare fish. Actions to prevent the extinction of the Barrens Topminnow include monitoring populations and propagating and stocking juveniles into existing or newly created spring habitats. The Tennessee Aquarium assisted with propagations and developed a program called \"Keeper Kids,\" where students on spring break help feed the Barrens Topminnows in a behind-the-scenes experience."
    },
    {
      "self_ref": "#/texts/2",
      "parent": {
        "$ref": "#/pictures/0"
      },
      "children": [],
